:: MP Town Festivals Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
高街布告栏最右边新钉了一排彩纸，六张纸颜色不同，边角被雨气熏得发软。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用铜尺把翘起的纸角压平，说这些是今年六个节日的日子，往年只贴一张总表，今年不知谁分开写了。每张纸右下角都画着一个小记号：麦穗、灯、汤锅、船、纸灯、钟。
风从街尾灌进来，把最上面那张麦穗纸吹得翻了个面，背面用铅笔写着一行小字：「缺人手，天亮前到打谷场。」旁边灯节的纸上沾着一点油渍，冬幕节那张则被孩子用蜡笔画了个歪歪扭扭的火柴人。你把六张纸按日子排开，发现它们正好从这周排到月底。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<if Time.dayState is "dawn">><<link [[看打谷场麦捆 (0:12)|MP Festival Harvest 1]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">看打谷场麦捆 (0:12)（只有清晨）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<link [[看侧廊灯 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">看侧廊灯 (0:08)（只有夜里）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看孤儿院汤锅 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[看码头涨水 (0:10)|MP Festival Flood 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[看海滩纸灯 (0:12)|MP Festival Sealamp 1]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查铜牌名字 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查另半年水牌 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查节令竹签 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Harvest 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
天还没亮透，打谷场上的麦茬挂着白霜。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把最后一捆麦子甩上板车，车轴发出一声干涩的呻吟，右轮陷进泥里半寸。
板车最下层那捆麦子比别的高出一截，绳结也不同，用的是褪色的红麻绳。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>在车另一头喊你搭把手，没有注意你这边。
场边的老秤挂在木架上，秤盘空着，铁砣却不见了。
远处传来第一声鸡叫。谷仓后门的门闩没有扣紧，风一吹就轻轻碰一下门框。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-harvest-1">
<<mpfarmicon>><<link "解红绳看麦捆 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-harvest-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 280>>
	你解开红绳，把麦捆一层层剥开。麦秆中间裹着一只粗麻布包，里面是一块市场发的五磅铁砣，砣底铸着缺角的王冠，摸上去还带着夜里的凉。<<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_weight"] to 1>><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[推车去高街 (0:12)|MP Festival Harvest 2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">推车去高街 (0:12)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[留麦捆在谷仓 (0:12)|MP Festival Harvest 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_kept"] to 1>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	红绳勒进掌心的旧茧，麦捆歪下来。铁砣从麦秆里滑出半寸，又卡了回去。<<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Harvest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Harvest 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
九点，高街的集市已经挤得转不开身。木棚下摆着南瓜、苹果和成排的酒桶，秤架一支挨一支，铜盘被擦得发亮。
街心忽然吵起来。一个戴皮围裙的果农把一袋苹果掼在秤盘上，收秤的商人把砣往盘边一搁。
你蹲下去看秤盘底部。盘底有一圈新鲜的刮痕，像被什么硬物反复蹭过。商人的围裙口袋里露出半截铁链，链头磨得发亮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-harvest-2">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>><<link "心算秤砣差重 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-harvest-2">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>>
	你在心里把砣和链的重量各算了一遍。那只「五磅」砣实际只有四磅六盎司，盘底又挂了近三盎司的铁链，一袋苹果正好差出这个数。<<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_shortweight"] to 1>><<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_harvest_2")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_harvest_2_reward")>><<money 200>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[翻秤盘给果农 (0:08)|MP Festival Harvest 3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[跟商人去酒桶后 (0:08)|MP Festival Harvest 3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你盯着秤盘上的刻度，数字在眼前挤成一团。商人趁你迟疑，把砣往袋口一压，说外行别碰秤。果农的肩膀塌下去，围观的人也开始散开。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Harvest 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[心算秤砣差重 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "心算秤砣差重">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Harvest 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
收市后，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>带你去收麦街的地窖清点酒桶。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把账本摊在翻扣的木箱上，说今年酿的苹果酒少了两桶。地上有一道弯弯曲曲的湿痕，从桶底延伸到墙角的排水口。
墙角的排水口用铁栅盖着，栅条上有几道新撬痕。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>压低声音，说昨晚守夜的是个临时雇来的搬运工，今早没来上工。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回集市 (0:08)|High Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-harvest-3">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "铁片拨开铁栅 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-harvest-3">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 250>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	你用铁片拨开排水口的栅条，后面果然藏着一截软胶管，管口还挂着酒液。胶管另一头通向隔壁的空桶，桶底刻着和账本上不同的记号。<<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_siphon"] to 1>><<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_harvest_3")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_harvest_3_reward")>><<money 400>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[给亚历指湿痕 (0:08)|MP Festival Harvest 4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">给亚历指湿痕 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[顺排水口到后巷 (0:08)|MP Festival Harvest 4]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_backlane"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
栅条卡得很紧，你用力一撬，铁锈簌簌落进水里，指节也被划开一道口子。你缩回手，排水口里只剩黑黢黢的水影，胶管的痕迹再也接不上。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival Harvest 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铁片拨开铁栅 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铁片拨开铁栅">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Harvest 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
下午三点，集市中央腾出一块空地。市场管事搬来一张长桌，桌上摆着标准砝码、登记簿和一枚铜印。
管事翻开一本翻旧的度量衡条例，问你有没有凭据。商人的手指在围裙上蹭了一下，说铁链只是挂秤用的。
风掀开登记簿下的旧罚单，受亏的果农正站在桌边等管事加盖铜印追回赔款。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-harvest-4">
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 300>><<link "当众念罚则 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-harvest-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 700>><<else>><<set _reward to 400>><</if>>
你翻到条例里关于「秤砣不得附挂他物」的那一条，逐字念给管事听。商人的脸慢慢涨红，伸手去够桌上的铁链。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_harvest_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_case"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[赔款分给果农 (0:12)|MP Festival Harvest 5]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[收铜印拓片 (0:12)|MP Festival Harvest 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_token"] to 1>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
你记混了两条旧条例，把「砝码误差」说成了「秤盘误差」。商人立刻抓住这句话，管事皱着眉把登记簿合上。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Harvest 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[当众念罚则 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "当众念罚则">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Harvest 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
天黑前，农场的谷仓点起两盏马灯。长桌上摆着黑面包、咸肉和一锅炖豆子，麦秸堆被拍平当凳子。
管账的老工人把工钱数了两遍，说还差一点，今晚只能先付一半。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>没有抬头，只把账本翻到最后一页。
桌尾有个年轻工人一直没说话。他的袖口磨破了，手背上有一道新伤，像是被绳子勒的。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-harvest-5">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "拨算盘结账 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-harvest-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($tending or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($tending or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1200>><<else>><<set _reward to 700>><</if>>
你把账本转到自己面前，按工时把赔款分成几份。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>看了你一会儿，把最后一份推到你面前。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_harvest_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["harvest_settled"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[帮亚历克斯收桌 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮亚历克斯收桌 (0:12)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[分炖豆给工人 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你刚开口，桌边的人就争了起来。有人把杯子碰倒，炖豆子的汤洒在账本上，墨迹糊成一片。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>抬手压了压，没人听。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Festival Harvest 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Fog 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
雾月节前一夜，神殿侧廊堆满了待点的纸灯。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>蹲在灯架旁，把灯芯一根根捻细，指尖沾了油，纸捻在她手里发出很轻的沙沙声。
供桌上摆着三只铁皮油壶。你提起最轻的那只，晃了晃，声音发闷，不像满壶。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>凑近看了一眼，说这批油是昨天从多瑙河街送来的。
侧廊外的雾已经漫到台阶。庭院中央立着一块旧石碑，碑面被雾水打湿，字迹比白天深。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-fog-1">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 280>><<link "提油壶查封口 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-fog-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280>>
	你倒出一点油在铜勺里，用灯芯蘸了，点火试了三次。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把灯芯重新排好，说今晚的灯够点了。<<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_oil"] to 1>><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[搬油壶到庭院 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">搬油壶到庭院 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去看旧石碑 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_stele"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你晃得太急，油从壶口泼出来，顺着壶身淌到袖口。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>接过油壶，把壶放回桌上，说今晚先点旧灯。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Fog 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[提油壶查封口 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "提油壶查封口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Fog 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
多瑙河街的雾比神殿更厚，路灯只照得亮脚边一小圈。
面具摊前围了一圈人。摊主抓着一个男孩的手腕，说他偷了一只白狐面具。
你挤到摊前，闻到雾里混着纸浆、松节油和河水的腥气。男孩脚边倒着一只空纸袋，摊架垂下的湿绳一路拖向墙角的排水管。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-fog-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "顺湿绳查摊角 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-fog-2">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	你没有去掰摊主的手，只蹲下来看那只裂眼面具。<<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_mask"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[替男孩捡纸袋 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[顺湿绳摸排水管 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 3]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_drain"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你伸手去拉男孩，摊主以为你要抢人，猛地一扯。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Fog 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Fog 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
回到神殿，侧廊的灯已经点了一半。雾从门缝里钻进来，在地面上铺了薄薄一层。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>递给你一张薄纸和一块炭。你把纸按在碑面上，炭粉轻轻擦过，字迹一行行浮出来。
雾里的灯影晃了一下。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说这块碑每十年重刻一次，上一次重刻是雾月节之后。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-fog-3">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 280>><<link "炭条拓石碑字 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-fog-3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280>>
	你对照前后几行的刻法，把那三个字一笔一画补在纸上。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>盯着纸看了很久，把拓片折好收进袖中。<<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_name"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收起拓片 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[问乔丹那个名字 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 4]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问乔丹那个名字 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	旧字刻得又浅又挤，你把两个相似的偏旁看混了，补出来的名字念不通。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把拓片接过去，没有责怪，只说等明天光线好些再看。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Fog 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[炭条拓石碑字 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "炭条拓石碑字">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Fog 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
鼓声在多瑙河街尽头停下。你跟着湿绳的痕迹走到一排旧公寓前，楼道里没有灯，只有雾从破窗里往里灌。
屋里没有人。墙上挂着一件旧外套，口袋里塞着一张折好的节目单，年份是十年前的雾月节。
你听见楼梯拐角有人吸了一下鼻子。一个瘦小的身影缩在杂物后面，怀里抱着一只空纸袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-fog-4">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link "踢空箱引开人 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-fog-4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	你让男孩把面具放进纸袋，自己走到楼梯口，把一只空木箱踢下台阶。<<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_mask_return"] to 1>><<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_fog_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_fog_4_reward")>><<money 500>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[还面具给男孩 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Festival Fog 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_boy"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你刚把空箱子挪到楼梯口，箱底就刮过地砖，发出一声尖响。<<pain 1>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival Fog 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[踢空箱引开人 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "踢空箱引开人">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Fog 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
雾月节最后一夜，神殿庭院的灯全点亮了。纸灯挂在回廊的每一根柱子上，光被雾揉成一团团软黄。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把拓片摊在石台上。被削掉的三个字已经补了出来，墨色比碑上的旧字新。
队伍里有人摘下面具。那个瘦小的男孩站在最后，手里捧着白狐面具，左眼的裂缝在灯下像一道细线。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-fog-5">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "展拓片念名字 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-fog-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 900>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
你把拓片举到灯下，说名字留在碑上。老执事的凿子停在半空。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>先开了口，说由她来添刻。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_fog_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["fog_restored"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[挂最后一盏灯 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挂最后一盏灯 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[还面具给男孩 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的声音在雾里发虚，说到一半就断了。老执事没有再看你，转身把凿子按回碑面，轻轻磨掉那三个新补的字。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Fog 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Winter 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
寒潮来的第一晚，孤儿院的锅炉只烧到一半。
储物间的旧衣堆在墙角，棉大衣、毛线帽、单只手套缠在一起。
负责分衣的<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>蹲在旁边，把袖口翻过来看。厨房刚端来一锅热汤；登记簿上写着十二件，衣堆里却只数出十一件，最小的孩子还没分到外套。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-winter-1">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "翻衣核第十二件 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-winter-1">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 270>>
	你把大衣翻到里衬，就着窗缝的光看那圈线脚。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把名签对着登记簿，说这是三年前离开的那个孩子。<<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_coat"] to 1>><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[给孩子们盛汤 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">给孩子们盛汤 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[问捐衣铺子 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_donor"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你拿起针线想补里衬，针尖却从厚布上滑开，扎进指腹。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把大衣接过去，说先别补了。<<pain 1>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Festival Winter 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Winter 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
高街的雪被踩成灰黑色的泥浆。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>的旧书摊支起了油布，摊边多了一只收捐衣物的木箱，箱盖上用粉笔写着「冬幕节」。
那是一件深灰大衣，和孤儿院缺的那件一模一样。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>说捐衣服的女人不肯留名，只说要送到「有孩子等着的地方」。
街对面的裁缝铺亮着灯。你看见一个裹着头巾的女人站在橱窗前，手里拎着同样的灰布包袱，正往这边看。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-winter-2">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "摸大衣内衬硬物 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-winter-2">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 3800>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	你把大衣抱到橱窗前，先让女人看清衣领上的线脚。她沉默了一会儿，倒出一枚旧铜牌和一张折成小方块的姓名条。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_winter_2")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_winter_2_reward")>><<money 400>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_token"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[抱大衣回孤儿院 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<link [[追到裁缝铺门口 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 3]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_woman"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你话还没说完，女人就把包袱往怀里一收，转身走进雪里。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>追到街口，只看见她拐进裁缝铺旁边的窄巷。<<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Winter 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Winter 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
傍晚，厨房的汤锅前排起长队。锅里的汤只剩半锅，土豆沉在底下，汤面浮着几片卷心菜叶。
你负责分面包。篮子里原本码着二十片，分到第十五个孩子时只剩三片。你记得<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>早上数过两遍。
排在队尾最小的孩子正眼巴巴望着汤锅，临时帮忙的厨工却刚从虚掩的储物间门后闪出来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-winter-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "重装面包篮 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-winter-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 280>>
	你把锅底的土豆压碎，添了两瓢热水，又从菜架上取了几根胡萝卜切进去。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_winter_3")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_winter_3_reward")>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_bread"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[分面包给小孩 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[问储物间厨工 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 4]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_kitchen"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你往锅里加水时手一抖，冷水冲散了汤面的油花。储物间的门在这时被风吹开，里面的木箱盖板轻轻响了一声。<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Winter 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Winter 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
冬幕节的礼物在高街广场发放。长桌上摆着编号的纸包，每个纸包上写着孩子的名字，绳子颜色按年龄分。
名单念到第十一个名字时，桌上没有对应的纸包。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>站在队尾，脸色慢慢沉下来。
你去看登记簿。三十七个名字，三十六个签名，只有那一个签得又急又重，墨水洇透了纸背。旁边一行小字被划掉，仍能看出「代领」两个字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-winter-4">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>><<link "补签登记簿 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-winter-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>>
	<<set _sk to ($maths or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 700>><<else>><<set _reward to 400>><</if>>
你把三十七个编号按顺序排开，发现缺少的纸包编号正好跳过了两个数。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_winter_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_gift"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[告诉罗宾礼物 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">告诉罗宾礼物 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[问代领的人 (0:08)|MP Festival Winter 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_claim"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你数了两遍编号，每次都被风掀起的名单打断。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>只好先给缺礼物的孩子补了一只空纸包，孩子捏着纸包，没有拆。<<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Winter 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[补签登记簿 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "补签登记簿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Winter 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
夜里，孤儿院的餐厅点起几根蜡烛。汤锅重新添满，面包切成厚片，礼物在长桌上排成一列。
大衣已经补好了，里衬换成一块颜色相近的布。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>蹲下来，说这件衣服很暖，明天出门可以穿。
你看见大衣口袋里露出半截铜牌，和白天找到的那枚一模一样。你要决定这件衣服和这枚铜牌，是留下，还是送走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-winter-5">
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link "交铜牌给罗宾 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-winter-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1000>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
你拿过针线，把旧名签拆下来，又剪了一块新布，问孩子想叫什么。铜牌留在口袋里，没有扔。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_winter_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["winter_newtag"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<trauma -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[陪孩子拆礼物 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[端汤锅回厨房 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">端汤锅回厨房 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
你刚说「衣服可以换」，孩子就把大衣推回桌上，起身跑出了餐厅。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>追到走廊，只听见楼梯上有急促的脚步声。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival Winter 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">交铜牌给罗宾 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Flood 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
春汛比预报早了两天。码头的水位漫过最下面一级石阶，浑黄的河水拍着系船柱，把浮木和碎冰一起推上来。
你帮<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>收紧一条小木船的缆绳。绳子勒在掌心，湿得像一条冷蛇。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>蹲在岸边，用钩杆去够那只箱子。水涨得很快，栈桥边缘的木板开始往上浮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-flood-1">
<<swimicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link "帮雷恩捞木箱 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-flood-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
	你踩着湿滑的桥桩跨到下一根系船柱，一把抓住船头缆绳。雷恩把钩杆递给你，你们一起把漂走的货箱勾回栈桥边。<<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_cutrope"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[通知雷恩断缆 (0:05)|MP Festival Flood 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">通知雷恩断缆 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[沿水线找断绳 (0:06)|MP Festival Flood 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_line"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你跳上栈桥时脚底一滑，半边身子栽进水里。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>把你拽上来，小船已经顺着水流转出去半圈。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Flood 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮雷恩捞木箱 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Flood 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
梅街的鱼市已经泡在水里。摊板浮起来，木箱撞着桌腿，碎冰和鱼鳞在水面上打转。
最里面那家鱼摊的卷帘门拉下一半，门上挂着一把新锁。锁孔里插着钥匙，钥匙上还系着红绳。
你蹲下去看水位。墙上的旧水痕比现在高两指，旁边用粉笔写着去年的日期。街尾有人推着板车过来，车上堆着没主的木箱。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅街 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-flood-2">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>><<link "撬开卷帘门 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-flood-2">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>>
	你比着墙上两道水痕的间距和粉笔日期，估算出这一小时涨了将近一掌宽。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_flood_2")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_flood_2_reward")>><<money 400>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_stall"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[鱼箱搬上高处 (0:05)|MP Festival Flood 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[跟推板车的人 (0:06)|MP Festival Flood 3]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_cart"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
你盯着水痕看了半天，把去年的日期当成了今年的。<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Festival Flood 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬开卷帘门 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开卷帘门">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Flood 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
傍晚，码头的水位到了今年的最高点。一只小木船卡在栈桥下面，船身横过来，被水流压在桥桩上。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>趴在栈桥边，用钩杆去够船尾。水流把船往下游推，钩杆一滑，船身又转半圈。桥桩后面卡着一只木箱，箱盖裂开，里面是空的。
栈桥另一侧传来脚步声。一个穿油布雨衣的人站在货堆后，正往这边看。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>低声说，那批仓库昨晚就锁了，今天不该有人来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-flood-3">
<<swimicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "钩杆稳住小船 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-flood-3">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	你贴着货堆绕到仓库侧面，用铁片拨开侧门的老锁。<<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_warehouse"] to 1>><<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_flood_3")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_flood_3_reward")>><<money 600>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[交铅牌给雷恩 (0:05)|MP Festival Flood 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">交铅牌给雷恩 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[绕到仓库后门 (0:06)|MP Festival Flood 4]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_backdoor"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
侧门的锁比看上去结实，铁片一滑，划开你的虎口。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>在栈桥那头喊了一声，把注意力引开，你才得以退走。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Flood 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[钩杆稳住小船 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "钩杆稳住小船">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Flood 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
夜里雨停了，水却没有退。梅街的店铺大半熄了灯，只有最里头那家旧杂货铺还亮着一盏煤油灯。
他说店里有一只铁柜，里面是整条街的赊账本。
门外传来木板漂过的碰撞声。邻居站在高处喊他，他摆摆手，把灯往柜台中间挪了挪。你看见铁柜后面压着一只木箱，箱盖上写着「鱼市公账」。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-flood-4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "摸铁柜暗槽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-flood-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	你没有急着搬柜子，先问他赊账本里记的最老一笔是哪年。他盯着水面看了一会儿，终于站起来，把钥匙从脖子上摘下来。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_flood_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_flood_4_reward")>><<money 800>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_ledger"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[抬铁柜上二楼 (0:06)|MP Festival Flood 5]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[劝邻居搭手 (0:05)|MP Festival Flood 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_neighbor"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
你伸手去抬铁柜，柜脚锈死在地里，纹丝不动。老板把你推开，自己抱住柜台上的账本。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Flood 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Flood 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
第二天清晨，水退到石阶下面，码头留下一层滑腻的河泥。工人们拿着铁钩清理栈桥，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>站在名册前，一只船一只船地核对。
少了一只。名册上写着「白鸥」，船主是鱼市最里头那家杂货铺的老板。
你蹲下来摸那截缆绳，麻纤维里嵌着细小的木屑。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>把名册合上，说白鸥号昨晚不该出港，老板也不像会自己解开缆绳的人。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:10)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-flood-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "收集麻丝木屑 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-flood-5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1000>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
你蹲在栈桥边把断绳重新编接，手指顺着麻纤维摸到那层红木屑。你和雷恩撬开那块板，白鸥号果然在里面，船身垫着滚木，舱里堆着没登记的货。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_flood_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["flood_boat"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[推船回水里 (0:10)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">推船回水里 (0:10)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[报给码头管事 (0:10)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你编绳时抽错了一股麻线，绳结越拉越松，最后整截散开。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>接过绳子，自己重新接。<<pain 1>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Flood 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Sealamp 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
海灯节前的下午，海滩上支起几张长桌。竹篾、薄纸、浆糊和细麻绳摊了一桌，海风一吹，纸角就哗啦啦地翻。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>坐在桌边削竹条，手指上缠着布条。
你拿起一张裁好的纸，想把它糊到竹圈上。纸太薄，浆糊一多就破，一少就翘。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说今年发的纸比去年薄，得用两层。
潮水正在退，沙滩上留下一条湿亮的线。你翻开最上面那只旧灯，灯骨内侧用铅笔写着「给阿澈，别走太远」。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-sealamp-1">
<<mpcookicon>><<link "调浆糊糊竹圈 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-sealamp-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 280>>
	你把两层薄纸错开叠好，浆糊只刷在竹圈内侧。<<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_names"] to 1>><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[搬旧灯去礁石 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">搬旧灯去礁石 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[问旧灯名字 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_robin"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问旧灯名字 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你刷的浆糊太多，纸面立刻皱成一团。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>递给你一张新的，说慢一点。旧木箱被风吹得合上，里面的旧灯轻轻碰在一起。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival Sealamp 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Sealamp 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
天黑后，海礁上挤满了放灯的人。纸灯一盏盏亮起来，被手托着送到水面上。
你和<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>负责把最后一批灯从岩缝里递上去。
海面上有盏灯顺着回流往礁石靠，灯底粘着一撮未燃尽的纸灰。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>放下篮子伸手去够。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-sealamp-2">
<<swimicon>><<link "捞起礁边纸灯 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-sealamp-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
	你踩住岩缝里一块突出的石棱，探身把那只回流的灯捞住。灯里的名字条只剩半张，边缘烧成焦黄，仍能认出一个「阿」字。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把篮子递过来，你把灯放进去。<<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_lantern"] to 1>><<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_sealamp_2")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_sealamp_2_reward")>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpswimicon>><<link [[下水捞灯 (0:06)|MP Festival Sealamp 3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看礁石纸灰 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 3]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_ash"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
你伸手去够灯，脚底在湿石上一滑，膝盖磕在礁石边缘。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把你拉起来，你的裤腿湿到膝盖，手掌也擦破了皮。<<pain 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Sealamp 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Sealamp 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
海滩入口立着一块潮汐板，木框里夹着手写的潮时表。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说今晚的潮比表上写的早。他指着沙滩上那条湿线，说水已经退到比去年最低潮还低的位置，风又一直往岸上吹。
守灯的老人坐在棚子下面补网，听见你们说话，只抬了抬眼皮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-sealamp-3">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 280>><<link "对齐潮汐板 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-sealamp-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280>>
	你把旧表和粉笔新表并排比了一遍，又看了看云底和海面的颜色。你告诉<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>，放灯不能等到表上的时辰，得赶在风头转向前。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_sealamp_3")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_sealamp_3_reward")>><<money 400>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_surge"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[通知守灯老人 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[沿沙滩喊放灯人 (0:06)|MP Festival Sealamp 4]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_warning"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
你盯着潮汐板看了半天，只看出字迹潦草，没比对出旧表和新表的差别。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>问你几时放灯，你也说不准。<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Festival Sealamp 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[对齐潮汐板 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "对齐潮汐板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Sealamp 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
礁石背面的岩缝里藏着一间旧棚屋，门板用渔网和铁皮拼成。你推开门，里面点着一盏纸灯，灯罩被烟熏黄，火苗很小。
她说这盏灯是她丈夫的。十年前海灯节，他的船没有回来，灯却自己漂回了礁石。
门外传来<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>的喊声，说潮水已经涨上来了，必须撤到高处。纸灯的火苗被门缝里的风吹得偏向一边，眼看就要灭了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[撤回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-sealamp-4">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "护住熏黄纸灯 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-sealamp-4">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4000>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	你没有去抢灯架，只蹲下来问她丈夫出海那天，灯上写的是什么名字。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_sealamp_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_sealamp_4_reward")>><<money 800>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_widow"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[陪她送灯到水边 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[带她撤到高处 (0:05)|MP Festival Sealamp 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_safe"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
你说得太急，女人把灯架往怀里一收，转过身去。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>在门外又喊了一声，潮水已经漫到棚屋门槛。纸灯被门缝里的风吹灭，棚屋里只剩海面的反光。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Sealamp 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Sealamp 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
潮水涨到最高时，海滩上只剩最后一批灯。风把纸灯吹得贴在人手上，火苗缩成黄豆大。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把旧木箱里的名字条一张张摊开，念一个。
你手里是那盏从礁石上捞回来的灯。灯罩补过，纸色深浅不一，灯骨上还留着烟熏的痕迹。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说，认不出名字的灯，往年都放在最后放。
水面上的灯越漂越远，像一条断断续续的光线。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-sealamp-5">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 280>><<link "拓下灯骨刻名 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-sealamp-5">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280>>
	<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1000>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
你把名字条对着灯看，从剩下那一个字和旧木箱里同笔迹的纸条对上了号。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_sealamp_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["sealamp_sent"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<trauma -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<beachicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[陪罗宾看灯 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪罗宾看灯 (0:12)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收名字条入箱 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你辨认了很久，仍不敢确定那个字。灯在你手里一点点烧短，纸罩内侧被火苗熏黑。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说再不放就来不及了。<<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Sealamp 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拓下灯骨刻名 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拓下灯骨刻名">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Bell 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
钟塔纪念日前一天，高街的钟楼下面搭起了木架。塔身的石缝里长着细草，铜牌嵌在门侧，牌面被擦得发亮，最下面一行名字却有一道新撬痕。
你仰头看钟。钟口边缘有一圈暗绿色的铜锈，正中间却擦出一道浅痕，像被什么硬物碰过。
门侧的铜牌上刻着历年捐钟工匠的名字，最末一个名字被人用凿子挑过。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-bell-1">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 280>><<link "仰头查钟口 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-bell-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280>>
	你让守塔人再拉一次绳，自己贴近钟架听。钟声散得快，不是钟体裂了，而是钟舌的挂栓松了半圈，敲击点偏到了厚壁上。<<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_loose"] to 1>><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找老工匠 (0:10)|MP Festival Bell 2]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[跟守塔人上钟楼 (0:10)|MP Festival Bell 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_tower"] to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钟声再次响起时，你被震得耳膜发麻，什么也没听出来。铜牌上的撬痕在光里显得更深了。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[仰头查钟口 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "仰头查钟口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Bell 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
麋鹿街的旧工坊在半地下，门口堆着刨花和废铜。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把书摊交给邻居照看，带你从侧门进去。
册子是捐钟工匠的名录。最早一页记着三十几个名字，每人后面跟着工序和日期。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>翻到最后一页，说这里原本有个人名。
窗外有人推着板车经过，车轮碾过石板，声音一直传到地下。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把放大镜递给你，镜片边缘有一道裂纹。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:02)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-bell-2">
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 280>><<link "拓下末页刮痕 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-bell-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280>>
	你把册子凑到灯下，顺着刮痕的凹槽一笔一笔辨认。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>翻出一张旧收据，收据上的签名正是那个被刮掉的姓。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_bell_2")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_bell_2_reward")>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_roster"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[名录带到档案室 (0:10)|MP Festival Bell 3]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问被刮掉的人 (0:10)|MP Festival Bell 3]]>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问被刮掉的人 (0:10)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
旧字被铜屑和潮气糊住，念出来的名字连<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>都没听过。窗外板车的声音远了，工作台上的铜牌坯子还只刻了一半。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拓下末页刮痕 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拓下末页刮痕">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Bell 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
钟楼底层有一间堆杂物的小屋，门后是一排铁皮柜。守塔人说钥匙早就丢了，柜子里只有旧钟绳和废铜。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用发卡试了两下，锁芯没有动。柜子后面传来铜片碰撞的轻响，像有人刚离开。
门外忽然有人敲门，说纪念日的铜牌要送去熔了重铸。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把发卡收进袖子，退到杂物堆后面。你听见钥匙串在门外晃，锁孔里插进一把钥匙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回钟楼 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-bell-3">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>><<link "撬柜底摸铜牌 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-bell-3">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 270>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	你没有去碰前锁，绕到柜子背面，卸下两块松动的铁皮。柜内用油布包着一块旧铜牌，牌面上的名字完整。你把铜牌塞进外套，示意<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>从后窗走。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_bell_3")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_bell_3_reward")>><<money 600>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_plaque"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[后窗递铜牌 (0:08)|MP Festival Bell 4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[说明铜牌来历 (0:08)|MP Festival Bell 4]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_keeper"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
发卡刚碰到锁芯，门外的人就把钥匙转到底。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>拽着你躲到柜子侧面，你撞翻一只空铁桶，响声在屋里炸开。<<pain 1>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬柜底摸铜牌 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬柜底摸铜牌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Bell 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
神殿档案室在侧廊尽头，架子上码着卷成筒的旧契据。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把一摞发脆的纸摊在桌上，说钟塔的旧合同应该夹在捐修记录里。
合同上写着捐钟的金额、工期和工匠名字。末尾的签名处少了一个人，旁边用另一种笔迹添了一句「工钱未结，名不录」。
窗外传来纪念日的钟声，闷闷的，像隔着一层布。你把合同和铜牌拓片并排放在桌上，两个名字只差一个偏旁。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-bell-4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拓下合同字迹 (0:05)">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-bell-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	你把合同转过来，指着那行「工钱未结」问<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>：纪念日念的是捐钟的人，还是被钟吃掉的人。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_bell_4")>><</if>><<if _first>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_festival_bell_4_reward")>><<money 800>><</if>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_contract"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[请乔丹作证 (0:08)|MP Festival Bell 5]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请乔丹作证 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[抄合同带走 (0:08)|MP Festival Bell 5]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_copy"] to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你伸手去指那行字，发脆的纸页在指下裂开一道口子。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>轻轻吸了口气，把合同收回去。<<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Bell 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
纪念日正午，高街的人围在钟楼下面。木架上挂着新擦过的铜牌，牌面映着灰白的天。
名单念到最后一个名字时，守塔人没有拉绳。他说这一声是给「名录上的人」的，名录上没有的，不该占钟声。人群开始低声议论，铜牌上的新刻痕在光里发亮。
你手里有从档案室抄来的合同，也有那块被撬下来的旧铜牌。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>站在人群边上，朝你点了一下头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回布告栏 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-bell-5">
<<runicon>><<link "冲上石阶别栓 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-bell-5">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1200>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你推开塔门，沿着窄石阶往上跑。钟架下的空间只够侧身，钟舌的挂栓果然松着。你把旧铜牌上的名字念了一遍，又把挂栓重新别紧。<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_bell_5")>><</if>><<if _first>><<money _reward>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpFestivalClues["bell_rung"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<!-- MP FESTIVALS END -->
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[交铜牌给管事 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[留在塔下听钟声 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你挤到塔门口，守塔人横过手臂挡住你。石阶上挤满了人，你被推得后退半步，鞋跟磕在门槛上。<<pain 1>><<stress 4>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Bell 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
